#
# S = ceil(sqrt(1572864)) = 1255. Four engine-precision (W=320) tables of 10^(+/-k):
#   f320_pow10_high_pos[hi] = 10^( 1255*hi),  f320_pow10_high_neg[hi] = 10^(-1255*hi)
#   f320_pow10_low_pos[lo]  = 10^( lo),       f320_pow10_low_neg[lo]  = 10^(-lo)
# hi in 0..1254 (ceil(1572864/1255)), lo in 0..1254 (S-1). NEGATIVE powers stored
# DIRECTLY (not 1/positive). Each entry: mantissa in [2^318,2^319) at value = mant*
# 2^(exp-317), round-half-even; emitted as five U64 limbs via U320.from_words5.
# f320_pow10 selects HIGH[|e|/1255] and LOW[|e|%1255] and does ONE engine multiply.
